usage: issue_text.py [-h] --input INPUT --issuer-config ISSUER_CONFIG
                     --head HEAD --private-workdir PRIVATE_WORKDIR --out OUT
                     --request-id REQUEST_ID --nonce NONCE
                     --record-id RECORD_ID
                     [--expect-record-id EXPECT_RECORD_ID]

Trusted issuer frontend: private text -> live vector -> encrypted signed
Learn. The encoder's four-record numerical test is retained in
results/run_001. This wrapper composes that encoder with the existing journal
issuer CLI. It does not submit a host proposal or bypass authority
verification/finality.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input INPUT
  --issuer-config ISSUER_CONFIG
  --head HEAD
  --private-workdir PRIVATE_WORKDIR
  --out OUT
  --request-id REQUEST_ID
  --nonce NONCE
  --record-id RECORD_ID
  --expect-record-id EXPECT_RECORD_ID
                        Optional exact cached-record comparison; omit for a
                        new text
